WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:07.716
[opening theme music playing]

01:46.731 --> 01:48.358
[music fades]

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:57.784 --> 01:59.160
[unsettling music playing]

01:59.828 --> 02:01.371
[heavy breathing]

02:02.247 --> 02:03.289
[sniffing]

02:29.649 --> 02:33.611
[Lady Maeda] I have already arranged it
with Director Ichiro of Ongseong Hospital.

02:36.739 --> 02:39.367
The child in your womb
will hold special meaning,

02:41.161 --> 02:44.789
not only to Mr. Ishikawa but also to me.

02:47.000 --> 02:48.418
So that being said,

02:49.878 --> 02:51.754
you need to be very careful, hmm?

02:52.255 --> 02:53.506
Take care of yourself,

02:54.382 --> 02:55.383
Miss Akiko.

03:03.183 --> 03:04.601
[Myeong-ja gasping]

03:04.684 --> 03:06.477
[muffled screaming]

03:17.572 --> 03:19.115
[panicked yelping]

03:19.199 --> 03:20.533
[breathing heavily]

03:21.701 --> 03:23.494
- [keys jangling]
- [cell door clangs]

03:24.829 --> 03:25.997
[lock clicks]

03:26.581 --> 03:27.957
[heavy breathing]

03:35.173 --> 03:38.509
[man] I'm sorry,
but we're all closed up for the day, miss.

03:42.180 --> 03:43.806
- [Myeong-ja inhales sharply]
- [screaming]

03:43.890 --> 03:45.350
[ominous music playing]

03:51.606 --> 03:53.191
- [scrabbling]
- [bones snapping]

03:57.070 --> 03:58.446
[music fades]

04:06.037 --> 04:07.705
[unsettling music playing]

04:07.789 --> 04:08.957
[groans sleepily]

04:15.672 --> 04:18.716
[soldier] The creature's spores stopped
floating around an hour ago.

04:19.842 --> 04:21.094
[Kato] Has she awakened?

04:22.720 --> 04:24.722
[soldier] No,
it hasn't shown any movement.

04:25.223 --> 04:27.475
Perhaps we used
too much nitrogen gas earlier?

04:28.351 --> 04:30.270
[creature breathing softly]

04:33.064 --> 04:35.108
[Kato] What are
you thinking about, Seishin?

04:35.608 --> 04:36.734
What's on your mind?

04:36.818 --> 04:38.695
[flesh squelching wetly]

04:47.704 --> 04:50.999
[Ichiro] Lt. Kato,
we have a distinguished guest.

04:51.082 --> 04:52.542
Her name is Lady Maeda.

04:52.625 --> 04:54.294
She is the wife to Commissioner Ishikawa

04:54.377 --> 04:58.256
and the daughter
to the most respected Lt. Gen. Maeda.

04:58.339 --> 05:01.926
This area's restricted. I'm afraid
outsiders are not allowed down here.

05:02.510 --> 05:06.222
Lt. Kato, Lady Maeda is
the hospital's most generous sponsor.

05:18.693 --> 05:19.777
Is that the creature?

05:22.030 --> 05:24.615
I would advise you not to get too close.

05:26.826 --> 05:28.369
[breathing heavily]

05:31.122 --> 05:32.040
Seishin.

05:32.123 --> 05:33.333
[flesh squelching wetly]

05:33.416 --> 05:35.001
[soft, sleepy snarling]

05:39.756 --> 05:41.924
So, Master Seishin, it looks like

05:43.551 --> 05:46.220
you are still alive.

05:46.804 --> 05:49.057
[snarling ferociously]

05:49.140 --> 05:50.350
[roaring]

05:51.351 --> 05:52.560
[Maeda gasps]

05:54.479 --> 05:56.230
[creature growling]

06:03.363 --> 06:04.655
[snarling]

06:07.492 --> 06:09.535
[roaring furiously]

06:11.579 --> 06:12.663
[bars clanging]

06:12.747 --> 06:14.540
[creature roaring]

06:15.541 --> 06:16.709
[bars clanging]

06:18.836 --> 06:21.089
[unsettling music playing]

06:35.728 --> 06:39.065
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN JUSTIFICATION AND EXCUSE

06:39.148 --> 06:41.734
EPISODE 8
AWAKENING

06:41.818 --> 06:43.528
[shivering]

06:45.321 --> 06:47.156
[man] He must have gone through
quite an ordeal.

06:48.491 --> 06:52.495
He hasn't been able to sleep at all.
Or swallow a bite of food!

06:54.372 --> 06:55.998
[Jun-taek's father]
What about Master Jang?

06:56.082 --> 06:57.542
[man] He didn't make it back.

06:58.042 --> 07:01.212
Also, all the merchants in town,
they have all been arrested.

07:02.380 --> 07:03.840
[sighs]

07:06.134 --> 07:07.343
[officer 1] Yes, hello.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.345
Yes, I completely understand.

07:09.429 --> 07:10.346
Yes, sir.

07:11.013 --> 07:12.473
Yes, sir. I'll let you know--

07:12.557 --> 07:15.268
Everyone, quiet! Sit back down right now!

07:21.482 --> 07:23.901
Hey, Mr. Gu,
do you know what's going on here?

07:23.985 --> 07:26.154
Why haven't we heard from Master Jang yet?

07:27.363 --> 07:28.448
Where is he?

07:28.531 --> 07:30.366
Is he not coming to save us?

07:33.119 --> 07:33.953
Is he?

07:35.288 --> 07:36.747
Ah shit. [breathes shakily]

07:38.374 --> 07:40.126
[solemn instrumental music playing]

07:44.338 --> 07:48.801
HOUSE OF GOLDEN TREASURE
PAWNSHOP

07:54.390 --> 07:56.726
CLOSED FOR THE DAY

08:15.328 --> 08:17.580
[Mrs. Nawol sighs]

08:20.124 --> 08:21.417
[inhales shakily]

08:21.501 --> 08:22.668
Master Jang.

08:24.420 --> 08:25.588
Where have you been?

08:27.215 --> 08:29.133
It's time for you to come back.

08:40.728 --> 08:41.687
Is he breathing?

08:44.982 --> 08:46.526
He's barely breathing, sir.

08:46.609 --> 08:49.278
All right, then,
you two take him to the medical unit.

08:49.820 --> 08:51.447
- Go right now.
- [both] Yes, sir!

08:58.120 --> 08:59.330
[weakly] Kill him.

09:01.999 --> 09:03.501
[groaning weakly]

09:03.584 --> 09:05.002
[tense music playing]

09:05.086 --> 09:06.045
[groans]

09:07.088 --> 09:08.339
Track him down…

09:10.758 --> 09:12.051
wherever he is,

09:13.761 --> 09:15.596
and kill the bastard.

09:15.680 --> 09:16.681
[groans painfully]

09:21.102 --> 09:21.936
[gasping]

09:22.687 --> 09:24.146
[tense music playing]

09:28.276 --> 09:29.235
[gasps weakly]

09:32.488 --> 09:34.156
[grunts, pants]

09:39.912 --> 09:40.788
[strained grunt]

09:42.331 --> 09:43.416
[pained groan]

09:43.499 --> 09:44.333
[pants]

09:50.089 --> 09:50.965
[pained groan]

09:53.509 --> 09:55.386
[breathing heavily]

10:10.484 --> 10:12.153
[groans, breathing shakily]

10:33.341 --> 10:35.635
[man] Stop where you are, all of you.
Stand back!

10:35.718 --> 10:37.219
[feet stomping]

10:39.472 --> 10:40.723
[footsteps approaching]

10:53.819 --> 10:55.237
[ominous music playing]

10:55.321 --> 10:56.322
[man] As you were.

10:56.405 --> 10:58.115
[feet stomping]

11:11.379 --> 11:13.798
Sir! Something's happened, sir.

11:17.718 --> 11:18.803
How urgent is it?

11:18.886 --> 11:21.305
First Sergeant Haneda was found
at the lower-level morgue,

11:21.389 --> 11:22.890
severely wounded from a gunshot.

11:24.016 --> 11:26.227
My apologies, Lady Maeda.

11:26.769 --> 11:28.521
Please wait here until I return.

11:37.029 --> 11:37.988
[door closes]

11:43.244 --> 11:44.745
[suspenseful music playing]

11:50.710 --> 11:51.794
[creature snarling]

11:53.045 --> 11:55.381
[roaring furiously]

11:56.298 --> 11:58.134
[heartbeat rhythm echoing]

11:58.217 --> 11:59.218
[door closes]

11:59.301 --> 12:00.177
[lock turns]

12:06.308 --> 12:07.435
Master Jang!

12:09.603 --> 12:11.689
What are you… doing here?

12:12.314 --> 12:14.275
I had some business to attend to.

12:15.526 --> 12:17.361
But then I missed
my chance to get out of here.

12:19.447 --> 12:20.614
So I need you

12:21.198 --> 12:23.701
to help me get out of here, Lady Maeda.

12:23.784 --> 12:25.035
[breathing shakily]

12:25.953 --> 12:27.496
[heartbeat rhythm speeds up]

12:29.874 --> 12:31.083
So what are you saying?

12:31.167 --> 12:33.544
There's still a Josenjing hiding
somewhere around here?

12:33.627 --> 12:35.504
Yes, sir.
He's running around here somewhere.

12:35.588 --> 12:36.797
[man] Director Ichiro!

12:38.674 --> 12:40.760
Looks like the Josenjing
is headed towards the lab.

12:40.843 --> 12:43.929
A guard just found fresh blood stains
located near that area.

12:48.684 --> 12:50.686
[ominous music playing]

12:53.689 --> 12:55.316
Lady Maeda, right now isn't…

12:56.108 --> 12:57.860
a good time, I'm afraid.

13:06.494 --> 13:08.037
Soldiers, we have an emergency!

13:08.120 --> 13:09.872
Lady Maeda has been taken!

13:09.955 --> 13:12.625
We need to find Lady Maeda right now!
She's in great danger!

13:12.708 --> 13:14.251
We need to find her now!

13:16.128 --> 13:17.338
[dramatic music playing]

13:33.813 --> 13:34.980
[breathing heavily]

13:35.064 --> 13:36.106
[knocking on door]

13:36.190 --> 13:37.274
Lady Maeda?

13:43.239 --> 13:44.406
[music fades]

13:44.490 --> 13:45.616
[tense music playing]

13:51.330 --> 13:53.541
Don't ask me any questions.
Just drive the car.

14:11.684 --> 14:13.227
[dramatic music playing]

14:17.773 --> 14:18.941
[Tae-sang] Just drive.

14:27.825 --> 14:28.826
[music fades]

14:30.244 --> 14:31.328
[Tae-sang] Thank you.

14:33.831 --> 14:35.207
[breathing shakily]

14:40.504 --> 14:41.964
[tender music playing]

14:45.467 --> 14:47.928
[driver] What should I do, ma'am?
Shall I stop?

15:11.118 --> 15:12.161
To Honmachi.

15:24.632 --> 15:25.716
[music fades]

15:27.426 --> 15:31.722
PAWNSHOP
CLOSED FOR THE DAY

15:31.805 --> 15:33.307
[solemn music playing]

16:12.888 --> 16:14.431
[solemn music continues]

16:21.814 --> 16:24.149
[Jung-won] Did you visit
the House of Golden Treasure again?

16:24.733 --> 16:25.818
[turns off engine]

16:29.655 --> 16:30.823
Have you been waiting long?

16:32.574 --> 16:34.535
It's been four days
since we got out of there.

16:35.035 --> 16:37.287
And we still haven't heard
from Master Jang.

16:37.997 --> 16:39.957
The chances of him being alive are slim.

16:41.208 --> 16:44.586
With that said,
our job was to find Myeong-ja,

16:44.670 --> 16:46.255
and that's what we did.

16:47.297 --> 16:48.757
It's time for us to go home.

16:51.176 --> 16:53.762
We should leave early in the morning,
so get ready.

16:54.263 --> 16:56.348
[Chae-ok] I should've stayed there
in his place.

16:57.683 --> 16:59.685
He made his choice.
It was the right thing.

16:59.768 --> 17:03.188
All he had to do was save Myeong-ja,
but he stayed there anyway.

17:05.482 --> 17:06.775
He stayed because of us.

17:08.777 --> 17:11.905
I should've stayed in the hospital,
found a way to rescue Mother.

17:13.365 --> 17:15.409
At the very least
I should've gotten my revenge

17:15.492 --> 17:17.286
on the men who did that to her.

17:19.872 --> 17:23.250
If I had rescued Mother,
Master Jang wouldn't have been left there.

17:24.084 --> 17:26.670
Now I feel really guilty
for leaving the hospital.

17:28.714 --> 17:30.049
What do you mean by that?

17:33.385 --> 17:34.386
[breathes shakily]

17:36.597 --> 17:38.432
I found Mother while we were inside.

17:41.268 --> 17:42.770
She is still alive.

17:45.773 --> 17:47.524
You probably saw her there too.

17:53.072 --> 17:54.656
[creature growling mournfully]

17:54.740 --> 17:55.866
[snarling]

17:56.909 --> 17:59.119
[screeching]

18:00.537 --> 18:01.497
[roaring]

18:02.122 --> 18:05.084
It's been like this
ever since Lady Maeda's visit earlier.

18:05.584 --> 18:08.337
It looks like
it's been aggravated by something, sir.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.588
[creature growling]

18:10.172 --> 18:12.257
Something must've triggered the creature.

18:12.341 --> 18:14.343
- [creature growls mournfully]
- Huh?

18:14.426 --> 18:16.303
She's not just aggravated.

18:16.804 --> 18:18.097
I think she's enraged.

18:20.140 --> 18:22.476
[creature growling]

18:22.559 --> 18:24.061
[roaring]

18:25.479 --> 18:26.855
[roaring]

18:28.524 --> 18:29.858
[growling]

18:34.655 --> 18:36.198
[solemn music playing]

18:47.709 --> 18:48.877
[breathing shakily]

18:51.380 --> 18:52.881
[screeching]

18:59.388 --> 19:01.348
[pained growling]

19:26.039 --> 19:27.541
[solemn music continues]

19:28.917 --> 19:30.210
[breathing shakily]

19:42.931 --> 19:43.932
[music fades]

20:07.956 --> 20:09.875
[machine winding]

20:09.958 --> 20:12.461
[electricity buzzing]

20:15.631 --> 20:17.007
[Mr. Gu splutters, gasps]

20:17.633 --> 20:18.884
[exhales sharply]

20:20.719 --> 20:21.929
Let me ask you again.

20:22.554 --> 20:24.806
Where are all the prisoners
you helped escape?

20:25.432 --> 20:26.683
[Mr. Gu groans weakly]

20:26.767 --> 20:28.810
[groans] I… I don't know.

20:29.519 --> 20:31.897
- [exhales sharply]
- Where is Master Jang hiding?

20:32.773 --> 20:33.732
[weakly] I wish…

20:36.193 --> 20:37.611
I wish I knew where he was.

20:41.573 --> 20:43.742
Am I not speaking clearly enough for you?

20:44.284 --> 20:46.828
Do you want me to start over? Hmm?

20:46.912 --> 20:48.330
[Mr. Gu grunting weakly]

20:48.830 --> 20:50.499
Start… start over.

20:50.582 --> 20:53.168
Go ahead, just start over.
See what happens.

20:53.252 --> 20:54.086
Go ahead.

20:54.586 --> 20:56.380
Start over. I don't know anything.

21:01.176 --> 21:02.928
[Mrs. Nawol] Has anybody ever

21:03.679 --> 21:05.973
ripped out your fingernails
from your hands?

21:06.056 --> 21:08.016
[choked grunting]

21:08.809 --> 21:09.726
[rapid breathing]

21:09.810 --> 21:12.062
[Mrs. Nawol] Has anyone
ever burned your skin?

21:12.145 --> 21:13.438
[Mr. Gu yelping]

21:13.522 --> 21:16.191
[pained screaming]

21:17.859 --> 21:20.112
[Mrs. Nawol] Have you ever
been electrocuted?

21:20.195 --> 21:21.446
[machine whirring]

21:21.530 --> 21:23.323
[electricity buzzing]

21:24.366 --> 21:26.243
[Mrs. Nawol] Do you know
what happens to a person

21:26.326 --> 21:30.372
when someone forces chili powder
and water up the person's nose

21:30.872 --> 21:32.541
while they hang upside down?

21:32.624 --> 21:34.418
[gasping, yelling]

21:34.501 --> 21:36.670
[Mrs. Nawol] You get to that point where

21:36.753 --> 21:39.548
you can no longer remember
you're a human being.

21:40.424 --> 21:43.176
If you're ever in
a situation like that, Mr. Gu,

21:43.802 --> 21:44.720
don't be a hero.

21:44.803 --> 21:48.974
It's just going to make it worse for you.
Instead, you should tell them everything.

21:49.057 --> 21:51.310
If you ever end up in that situation,

21:52.019 --> 21:53.770
if you betray us, I won't resent you.

21:54.521 --> 21:55.772
Just keep that in mind.

21:56.273 --> 21:57.357
[groans weakly]

21:57.441 --> 21:58.734
[spluttering]

21:58.817 --> 22:00.235
[officer] Let me ask you again.

22:00.319 --> 22:02.779
What is the true purpose
of the House of Golden Treasure?

22:03.280 --> 22:04.406
Are you rebels?

22:05.157 --> 22:07.326
Have you all been
secretly funding the rebellion?

22:07.409 --> 22:08.702
[Mr. Gu moaning]

22:09.369 --> 22:10.871
[yelling] Hey, answer me!

22:12.372 --> 22:15.334
Why aren't you answering me, huh?!
Where is Master Jang?!

22:16.335 --> 22:17.336
[moaning loudly]

22:25.010 --> 22:26.845
[moaning weakly]

22:28.096 --> 22:29.806
Okay…

22:32.142 --> 22:33.060
[sniffs]

22:40.984 --> 22:42.069
[breathing sleepily]

22:50.410 --> 22:51.953
[door sliding open]

22:56.041 --> 22:57.042
Are you well rested?

23:00.045 --> 23:01.129
Lady Maeda, it's you.

23:20.065 --> 23:21.942
Well, it looks like your fever's gone.

23:22.025 --> 23:24.694
And those wounds of yours
are doing much better.

23:29.491 --> 23:31.243
How long… [breathes shakily]

23:31.326 --> 23:32.828
…have I been over here for?

23:34.329 --> 23:36.331
As of today, it's been four days.

23:41.128 --> 23:45.424
Well, I have to admit you caused…
quite the commotion at Ongseong Hospital.

23:48.176 --> 23:51.388
It was unexpected for me
to see you risk your life for someone.

23:52.055 --> 23:53.557
It's not like you, is it?

23:56.017 --> 23:56.935
[Tae-sang scoffs]

23:59.688 --> 24:00.689
I know.

24:02.065 --> 24:03.275
But things are different now.

24:05.569 --> 24:08.738
It's not my fault
that my country has become this way.

24:08.822 --> 24:10.323
[solemn music playing]

24:11.074 --> 24:14.911
I personally have nothing to do
with everyone who was locked up in there.

24:18.206 --> 24:19.374
So why help them?

24:20.000 --> 24:21.084
Because…

24:23.462 --> 24:25.630
because once I saw it with my own eyes,

24:26.882 --> 24:28.550
that's when I got really angry.

24:29.426 --> 24:30.802
I wanted to help.

24:31.720 --> 24:35.765
Master Jang, you're not making any sense.
You helped because they're Joseon?

24:38.643 --> 24:40.562
It's not only because they're Joseon.

24:41.521 --> 24:43.148
It's because I'm a human being.

24:45.066 --> 24:47.486
Do you think that every life has meaning?

24:47.569 --> 24:49.696
Do you believe
all lives are created equal?

24:52.282 --> 24:54.159
Yes. What do you believe, Lady Maeda?

24:56.286 --> 24:57.162
[chuckles softly]

25:00.624 --> 25:01.666
Master Jang,

25:03.126 --> 25:05.378
you and I, are we still friends?

25:24.105 --> 25:25.357
You said a serial murder case?

25:25.440 --> 25:29.110
Yes, sir, 11 murders have occurred
in the area over the past four days alone.

25:29.194 --> 25:31.196
We've asked the military for autopsies.

25:31.279 --> 25:34.449
However, a large number of the corpses
are in such a strange state.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.826
What do you mean by that? Strange how?

25:37.410 --> 25:40.288
Every one of the corpses were…
missing its brain, sir.

25:43.917 --> 25:45.794
[unsettling music playing]

25:45.877 --> 25:46.753
[gasps]

25:55.845 --> 25:57.722
[suspenseful music playing]

26:02.727 --> 26:04.563
[ominous beat]

26:14.823 --> 26:17.033
He's from the military ward, Commissioner.

26:24.332 --> 26:25.292
[music fades]

26:28.169 --> 26:30.005
[phone ringing]

26:30.088 --> 26:31.089
[gasps]

26:32.382 --> 26:33.675
Yes, how may I help you?

26:34.718 --> 26:35.760
I'm sorry.

26:36.720 --> 26:38.221
The store's not for sale.

26:40.599 --> 26:42.100
No, where'd you hear that?

26:43.935 --> 26:44.936
Who's dead?

26:45.854 --> 26:48.064
What else has everyone
been saying about him?

26:48.940 --> 26:50.900
Now, just wait a minute, sir! [scoffs]

26:51.401 --> 26:54.738
That's stupid. Only the dumbest idiot
could ever believe that were true.

26:54.821 --> 26:58.033
Watch your mouth! Exactly who
do you think you are? I'm serious!

26:58.908 --> 27:02.037
I'll make you regret that.
Yes, I'll sew your mouth shut.

27:04.205 --> 27:05.040
[huffs]

27:05.915 --> 27:07.500
Who are they to say something like that?

27:07.584 --> 27:10.962
The nerve of some people,
pronouncing someone to be dead.

27:11.838 --> 27:12.839
[Mrs. Nawol sighs]

27:13.340 --> 27:15.717
- [footsteps approaching]
- [Mrs. Nawol sighs]

27:18.720 --> 27:20.639
[phone ringing]

27:22.641 --> 27:25.143
My God, has everyone in town
gone completely crazy?

27:27.604 --> 27:29.522
- [revelatory music playing]
- [Mrs. Nawol whimpers]

27:31.441 --> 27:32.776
Yes, how may I help you?

27:34.069 --> 27:36.529
About that, I believe that, uh,

27:36.613 --> 27:39.324
my associate here
has explained that to you already.

27:40.116 --> 27:41.284
Who am I, you ask?

27:42.661 --> 27:44.788
The master
of the House of Golden Treasure,

27:45.997 --> 27:47.165
Jang Tae-sang.

27:51.419 --> 27:52.253
Yes.

27:52.754 --> 27:55.298
No, I'm not dead.
That's right. I'm very much alive.

27:59.177 --> 28:02.681
It's seems everyone wants to get
a little piece of our pawn shop.

28:02.764 --> 28:03.723
Don't they now?

28:05.475 --> 28:07.727
[voice trembling]
Master Jang, you're here.

28:08.311 --> 28:09.396
Didn't I say

28:09.938 --> 28:13.441
there was no need to close up the shop
just because I was gone for a few days?

28:13.525 --> 28:15.610
No wonder everyone thinks we're for sale.

28:16.986 --> 28:17.946
Well…

28:19.948 --> 28:21.116
what took so long, huh?

28:22.742 --> 28:24.077
Sorry, I got held up.

28:24.786 --> 28:25.995
[relieved sobbing]

28:27.038 --> 28:30.208
So you're not hurt at all, then?
You're fine?

28:30.291 --> 28:31.793
I'm okay. Mm-hmm.

28:32.460 --> 28:33.628
In that case!

28:34.254 --> 28:36.840
Why didn't you come home earlier
if you weren't injured?

28:36.923 --> 28:38.258
What took you so long?!

28:38.341 --> 28:41.261
I almost had a heart attack
because I was so worried!

28:41.344 --> 28:43.972
- Did you even think about that?
- Ah, I'm sorry I did that.

28:44.055 --> 28:46.474
- I did have my reasons, you know.
- [sobbing]

28:46.558 --> 28:49.269
Don't be upset with me, Mrs. Nawol.
I'm back now.

28:49.352 --> 28:50.770
[Mrs. Nawol sniffles]

28:54.733 --> 28:56.151
I said I was sorry. Don't cry.

28:58.653 --> 29:00.071
It doesn't matter now.

29:01.990 --> 29:05.160
Besides, you have to go pick up Mr. Gu.

29:06.161 --> 29:07.036
[sighs]

29:11.708 --> 29:12.792
Where is Mr. Gu now?

29:13.293 --> 29:15.086
[solemn music playing]

29:20.341 --> 29:21.426
[door locking]

29:22.969 --> 29:25.096
- [Mr. Gu groaning weakly]
- [shushing]

29:42.155 --> 29:43.281
[Mr. Gu groaning]

29:45.658 --> 29:47.035
[spluttering]

29:47.118 --> 29:49.078
[shocked gasps]

29:49.829 --> 29:50.705
[Yeong-chun] No!

29:50.789 --> 29:53.458
- [footsteps approaching]
- Oh no.

29:56.836 --> 29:57.670
Come out now.

29:58.630 --> 29:59.672
[panicked breathing]

30:01.549 --> 30:02.759
[prisoners whimpering]

30:02.842 --> 30:05.762
No! Let me go! No! I'm not going! No!

30:05.845 --> 30:07.847
- [squealing]
- I said out!

30:07.931 --> 30:09.265
[gasps, breathes heavily]

30:09.808 --> 30:11.142
[solemn music playing]

30:15.814 --> 30:17.106
Master Jang, it's you.

30:21.236 --> 30:22.654
[gasps] Is that Master Jang?

30:23.905 --> 30:25.281
Is that really Master Jang?

30:25.365 --> 30:27.659
- [man] No way!
- [woman] I think it's him!

30:27.742 --> 30:29.327
[shocked whispering]

30:37.544 --> 30:38.878
Just wait here, okay?

30:40.088 --> 30:41.297
Hey, stop right there!

30:42.173 --> 30:44.384
Master Jang,
where do you think you're going?

30:45.510 --> 30:47.387
[officers chattering indistinctly]

30:47.470 --> 30:50.223
Isn't that Master Jang
of the House of Golden Treasure?

30:54.853 --> 30:56.771
I need to talk to Commissioner Ishikawa.

30:56.855 --> 30:58.147
[officer] Hey, you!

30:58.231 --> 31:00.191
Are you ignoring me or what, huh?

31:01.484 --> 31:03.319
Go and tell him Master Jang is here.

31:03.403 --> 31:04.988
You bastard! Are you deaf or what?!

31:07.198 --> 31:09.117
Why are you swinging your fist at me?

31:09.200 --> 31:12.161
Are you a police officer or a thug?
It's not very professional.

31:16.374 --> 31:17.542
You're all policemen.

31:18.126 --> 31:20.628
Would it be too much to ask
for you to act like it?

31:21.337 --> 31:22.171
[door opens]

31:35.351 --> 31:37.812
You caused quite the stir
over at the hospital.

31:39.564 --> 31:41.733
You told me I should do
whatever it takes, did you not?

31:43.234 --> 31:44.319
Yes, that's true.

31:44.903 --> 31:47.488
But what did you do with
the Joseon prisoners you helped escape?

31:47.572 --> 31:49.157
That wasn't part of the deal.

31:51.159 --> 31:53.536
I actually have no idea
what you're talking about.

31:55.705 --> 31:57.206
I'm here on behalf

31:57.290 --> 32:00.501
of all the Joseons in custody
you have wrongfully imprisoned here.

32:00.585 --> 32:02.170
Please release them immediately

32:02.253 --> 32:04.714
as the charges against them
are completely false.

32:06.341 --> 32:09.385
But so many of our laws
were broken that night, I'm afraid.

32:09.886 --> 32:12.096
Playing foreign music,
drinking alcohol in public,

32:12.180 --> 32:15.892
violating public safety codes,
not to mention many other misdemeanors.

32:15.975 --> 32:18.061
How about we settle this
with a simple fine?

32:18.144 --> 32:20.438
You think you can fix this
by throwing me some money?

32:20.521 --> 32:23.066
I think that that is the easiest way
to clean up everything.

32:25.860 --> 32:26.861
What if I refuse?

32:27.695 --> 32:30.198
Well, every business
in the district of Bonjeong

32:30.281 --> 32:31.950
will be shut down for the time being.

32:33.201 --> 32:37.705
I'm sure you know the fundraising party
is being held in Gyeongseong in two days.

32:38.289 --> 32:39.540
With the businesses closed,

32:39.624 --> 32:42.877
all deliveries of alcohol and food
to the event will be halted.

32:42.961 --> 32:44.879
Just think about
all the officials and their wives

32:44.963 --> 32:46.965
who've ordered garments
to be made for the occasion.

32:47.048 --> 32:49.342
I wonder how this will look for you.

32:50.969 --> 32:52.428
Since you oversee everything,

32:52.512 --> 32:54.889
an investigation
will be launched immediately.

32:54.973 --> 32:58.142
Your superiors will most definitely
hold you accountable for this.

32:58.685 --> 32:59.727
Is that a threat?

33:00.561 --> 33:01.688
[inhales sharply]

33:01.771 --> 33:04.649
There comes a point in time
when two enemies can, uh,

33:05.191 --> 33:07.026
form a temporary alliance together.

33:07.735 --> 33:11.739
We are simply just having a conversation
on how to help one another.

33:12.991 --> 33:14.742
You are walking a fine line here.

33:15.535 --> 33:18.538
It'd be best if you didn't risk your life
for matters that don't concern you.

33:24.127 --> 33:28.297
So my little visit at Ongseong Hospital
taught me something very important.

33:29.674 --> 33:31.676
When you put your own life on the line,

33:32.427 --> 33:33.845
you have to go all-in.

33:35.179 --> 33:37.432
And if you hesitate
even for a single minute,

33:38.599 --> 33:39.767
you will end up dead.

33:42.395 --> 33:43.896
[Kato] If I may, Commissioner.

33:43.980 --> 33:46.232
I have an idea who the prime suspects are.

33:48.109 --> 33:50.528
Master Jang
of the House of Golden Treasure.

33:50.611 --> 33:53.740
The sleuth, Yoon Chae-ok, as well as

33:54.407 --> 33:55.450
a courtesan.

33:56.159 --> 33:57.618
A Joseon named Akiko.

33:57.702 --> 33:58.911
[tense music playing]

33:59.954 --> 34:00.788
[retching]

34:01.956 --> 34:03.291
[gasping]

34:05.501 --> 34:06.919
- [retching]
- Miss Akiko?

34:08.087 --> 34:10.506
- Are you feeling all right?
- [breathing heavily]

34:16.888 --> 34:20.892
Do you have a… specific reason
why those are your prime suspects?

34:20.975 --> 34:23.728
Because all three have been
in this hospital, Commissioner.

34:23.811 --> 34:27.565
They broke into this ward,
and then… they all escaped together.

34:28.316 --> 34:31.611
Lieutenant, I'd like to know…
exactly what is going on in that hospital?

34:31.694 --> 34:34.739
Well, I'm not inclined
to disclose that kind of information.

34:34.822 --> 34:36.532
That information is classified.

34:44.165 --> 34:45.166
Akiko.

34:49.420 --> 34:50.254
Aki--

34:56.636 --> 34:58.054
[ominous music playing]

35:20.118 --> 35:21.744
What the hell? What is this?

35:26.624 --> 35:27.708
Tell me, Master Jang.

35:29.127 --> 35:30.711
I want to know what you saw in there.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.549
I want to know
everything that was happening

35:34.632 --> 35:37.093
inside of that hospital
right this second! Huh?

35:41.055 --> 35:43.057
[clicks tongue] As you already know,

35:43.683 --> 35:46.394
the price for my services
is quite steep, Commissioner.

35:46.894 --> 35:50.231
The kind of information you're asking for,
about military hospital secrets,

35:50.314 --> 35:52.525
now, that's gonna be
top-level information.

35:53.025 --> 35:54.944
I most likely
wouldn't hand it over so easily,

35:55.027 --> 35:57.196
especially something
of that caliber, you know?

35:57.280 --> 35:58.781
Are you trying to bribe me?

35:58.865 --> 36:00.533
Commissioner Ishikawa,

36:00.616 --> 36:03.494
what I hope to achieve here is
that we gain mutual trust for one another.

36:04.996 --> 36:09.167
Not to mention I kept my word to you.
I returned Akiko to you safe and sound.

36:11.752 --> 36:13.379
Now you return the favor.

36:15.381 --> 36:17.049
Release my people, Commissioner.

36:31.647 --> 36:32.690
[officer] Get out!

36:33.608 --> 36:35.276
You are all released!

36:35.359 --> 36:36.986
We're released! We're really free!

36:37.069 --> 36:39.363
- We're really getting out!
- [excited chatter]

36:39.447 --> 36:41.199
I can't believe it! We're getting out!

36:41.282 --> 36:43.159
Oh my God. Thank you, Master Jang!

36:43.242 --> 36:46.162
Master Jang got us out of here!
I can't believe it. We're all free!

36:46.245 --> 36:48.164
I can't believe it! Everybody's out.

36:48.998 --> 36:51.459
Everybody's free!
We're getting out of here alive!

36:51.542 --> 36:54.253
- I can't believe it! Let's go home!
- [relieved sighing]

36:59.467 --> 37:01.469
[excited chatter fading]

37:13.272 --> 37:14.523
Master Jang, it's you.

37:18.361 --> 37:19.570
You're really alive?

37:20.071 --> 37:21.489
[solemn music playing]

37:23.866 --> 37:25.117
Mr. Gu, are you able to walk?

37:27.495 --> 37:30.665
What took you so long? [sobbing]

37:40.758 --> 37:42.134
Let's get you out of here.

37:44.679 --> 37:45.596
[Mr. Gu sobbing]

37:45.680 --> 37:47.848
- All right, hang on.
- [whimpering]

37:49.976 --> 37:52.979
- [man 1] Bonjeong!
- [prisoners chanting] Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

37:53.062 --> 37:56.190
Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

37:56.274 --> 37:58.859
- Bonjeong! Bonjeong!
- Do you all want to die here?

37:59.485 --> 38:01.529
- Then quiet down!
- [terrified screaming]

38:14.542 --> 38:17.545
[prisoners chanting] Bonjeong!
Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:17.628 --> 38:19.922
Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:20.006 --> 38:22.508
Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:22.591 --> 38:24.176
Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:24.260 --> 38:26.679
Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:26.762 --> 38:28.431
Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:28.514 --> 38:30.141
Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:30.224 --> 38:32.560
Bonjeong! Bonjeong! Bonjeong!

38:32.643 --> 38:34.228
- Mori.
- Yes, sir?

38:35.479 --> 38:36.314
Commissioner.

38:36.397 --> 38:38.607
I want you to keep tabs
on where Master Jang goes.

38:38.691 --> 38:41.444
Sir? But what for, sir?

38:42.862 --> 38:46.532
All right, um…
I will do what you ask, Commissioner.

38:51.579 --> 38:54.707
ONGSEONG HOSPITAL UNDERGROUND LAB
HUMAN EXPERIMENTS, LADY MAEDA

38:58.711 --> 39:02.256
LADY MAEDA

39:02.340 --> 39:03.883
[solemn music continues]

39:11.724 --> 39:12.725
[music fades]

39:15.186 --> 39:16.103
[Mrs. Nawol gasps]

39:16.854 --> 39:17.688
Oh…

39:18.481 --> 39:20.858
Don't worry too much. He'll be all right.

39:22.777 --> 39:26.322
I'm in his debt now.
I have to make things right with him.

39:26.405 --> 39:27.490
No, you don't.

39:28.366 --> 39:31.619
You've saved Mr. Gu's life
so many times now that I've lost count.

39:32.244 --> 39:34.038
In fact, all of us owe our lives to you.

39:36.082 --> 39:37.708
[solemn music playing]

39:41.712 --> 39:43.381
The trauma from being tortured,

39:45.299 --> 39:46.592
it lasts a while, doesn't it?

39:50.304 --> 39:51.472
Why don't you get some sleep?

39:54.600 --> 39:56.685
No, it's okay. I wanna stay right here.

39:56.769 --> 39:59.146
There's someone else waiting for you,
just so you know.

40:02.858 --> 40:04.652
She came by here every single day.

40:05.653 --> 40:08.155
She kept visiting to see
if you had come home safely.

40:09.782 --> 40:11.117
Leave Mr. Gu to me.

40:11.826 --> 40:13.536
Go pay her a visit, Master Jang.

40:21.919 --> 40:23.462
[solemn music continues]

40:48.612 --> 40:49.989
[music fades]

40:52.241 --> 40:54.326
Are you not going to have dinner tonight?

40:54.410 --> 40:57.538
[Jung-won] I'm not hungry.
Go ahead and eat.

40:57.621 --> 41:00.124
How about some dumplings?
I can go buy some for you.

41:03.752 --> 41:05.546
I'll get some. I'll be right back.

41:09.925 --> 41:11.302
[footsteps receding]

41:25.149 --> 41:26.859
[indistinct background chatter]

42:02.770 --> 42:04.855
- [knife unsheathes]
- [Chae-ok] Show yourself.

42:13.864 --> 42:18.786
["Time" by Baek A playing]
♪ Candles lit in the room ♪

42:19.662 --> 42:20.955
♪ Staring for… ♪

42:21.038 --> 42:23.415
And somehow here I was
hoping for a warm welcome.

42:25.626 --> 42:30.506
♪ Where the wind came from… ♪

42:31.465 --> 42:35.219
Now that you have seen my face…
would you mind letting me go?

42:42.560 --> 42:43.561
It's really you.

42:44.812 --> 42:46.647
[gasps, relieved sob]

42:47.815 --> 42:48.649
[relieved sigh]

42:58.325 --> 43:03.706
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

43:04.665 --> 43:11.297
- ♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪
- [relieved sobbing]

43:11.797 --> 43:16.010
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall… ♪

43:16.510 --> 43:17.761
I feel the same way.

43:17.845 --> 43:21.181
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

43:21.265 --> 43:22.182
I've missed you.

43:24.893 --> 43:26.478
I've missed you more than you would know.

43:41.702 --> 43:43.704
[Chae-ok breathing shakily]

43:44.622 --> 43:45.539
[relieved sigh]

43:56.091 --> 43:57.593
[music fades]

43:57.676 --> 43:59.136
Exactly what is it you wanna know?

43:59.219 --> 44:00.512
I want to know…

44:00.596 --> 44:01.639
[chimes tinkling]

44:02.806 --> 44:08.145
…what goes on inside of Ongseong hospital
and the… basement laboratory below it.

44:13.817 --> 44:17.321
Are you even remotely aware
of what is happening in Ongseong Hospital?

44:17.404 --> 44:19.615
There's nothing that goes on
I don't know about.

44:23.911 --> 44:25.579
What have you done to Akiko this time?

44:30.918 --> 44:32.920
I asked you a question.
Why aren't you answering?

44:33.003 --> 44:36.006
It sounds like
you are a little confused right now.

44:37.091 --> 44:40.678
You have forgotten you do not have
any right to ask such things of me.

44:41.804 --> 44:44.056
I don't owe you
an explanation about anything.

44:44.807 --> 44:45.724
Oh, yes, you do.

44:45.808 --> 44:48.852
From the very beginning,
we both… had an understanding

44:48.936 --> 44:51.480
that this marriage was formed
for mutual benefit.

44:52.648 --> 44:56.402
I was in need of a loyal husband
in order for me to come here to Joseon.

44:57.611 --> 45:02.116
And you… needed
my powerful name and lineage

45:02.199 --> 45:03.659
to move up and succeed.

45:05.494 --> 45:09.081
It feels rather awkward now
to suddenly pretend

45:09.164 --> 45:11.709
that… you're my husband now,

45:12.584 --> 45:13.711
Commissioner Ishikawa.

45:16.296 --> 45:18.966
You shouldn't have crossed the line
and meddled with Akiko.

45:20.259 --> 45:21.927
And you should not have employed

45:22.010 --> 45:24.471
the master of the House of Golden Treasure
to find her.

45:24.555 --> 45:27.641
We agreed we wouldn't interfere
in each other's lives, didn't we?

45:27.725 --> 45:30.394
But you're the one who decided
not to honor the arrangement.

45:30.477 --> 45:33.647
It's your own business
what you decide to do at night.

45:34.606 --> 45:37.067
However, when you impregnate someone else,

45:37.735 --> 45:40.070
it complicates our original arrangement.

45:40.654 --> 45:41.488
[scoffs]

45:48.787 --> 45:49.621
Oh,

45:50.122 --> 45:54.126
I don't know if you've heard yet…
but Master Jang has found himself a woman.

45:54.209 --> 45:55.544
[tense music playing]

46:00.340 --> 46:02.134
Her name is Yoon Chae-ok.

46:02.217 --> 46:03.886
I heard she is a Joseon woman.

46:04.595 --> 46:08.474
Apparently, she's young and beautiful too.
How unfortunate for you.

46:08.557 --> 46:09.391
[chuckles]

46:10.017 --> 46:11.977
I thought you would like to know that,

46:12.561 --> 46:15.939
considering all of that time
and effort nursing him back to health.

46:16.648 --> 46:18.525
I suppose it was all in vain now.

46:38.378 --> 46:39.379
[music fades]

46:41.465 --> 46:42.883
[door slides open]

46:43.592 --> 46:44.718
[door slides closed]

46:51.517 --> 46:53.143
[indistinct background chatter]

46:59.149 --> 47:00.400
[shaky breathing]

47:20.420 --> 47:22.506
- [tender music playing]
- [Tae-sang] Hmm…

47:42.442 --> 47:43.360
Hmm…

47:46.655 --> 47:47.698
[chuckles]

47:55.706 --> 47:57.583
[woman] Here are your dumplings, miss.

47:59.209 --> 48:00.711
[Tae-sang sighs awkwardly]

48:05.757 --> 48:06.842
Hmm…

48:09.803 --> 48:11.054
How about we go?

48:14.808 --> 48:16.059
Saw that! Huh!

48:16.852 --> 48:18.562
[girl] Gimme a bite of your food.

48:18.645 --> 48:20.063
[boy] No! [chuckles]

48:21.106 --> 48:22.399
Go get your own!

48:22.482 --> 48:23.817
This one's mine.

48:24.902 --> 48:26.862
[children giggling]

48:28.363 --> 48:29.323
[Tae-sang clears throat]

48:37.414 --> 48:38.540
[gunshot echoes]

48:38.624 --> 48:39.499
[music fades]

48:44.463 --> 48:46.256
[ominous music playing]

48:54.097 --> 48:55.182
[Mori whimpering]

48:55.265 --> 48:56.600
[ominous music continues]

49:00.896 --> 49:02.940
[Mori] Don't come any closer! [panting]

49:08.612 --> 49:09.780
[breathing shakily]

49:12.157 --> 49:14.242
Go… go away. Go away!

49:14.326 --> 49:16.286
Get away from me!

49:16.370 --> 49:17.746
[Myeong-ja gasps]

49:17.829 --> 49:20.123
- [choked gasping]
- [Myeong-ja grunting]

49:24.461 --> 49:26.463
[Mori screaming]

49:27.130 --> 49:28.590
[screaming continues]

49:33.345 --> 49:34.554
[thud]

49:34.638 --> 49:35.722
[Mori screaming]

49:35.806 --> 49:37.599
[dramatic music playing]

49:38.684 --> 49:41.061
[Mori gasping painfully]

50:03.834 --> 50:04.751
M…

50:05.836 --> 50:07.754
Myeong… Myeong-ja?

50:20.225 --> 50:21.393
[music fades]

50:21.977 --> 50:23.186
Is this it?

50:24.021 --> 50:25.856
The Najin parasite you discovered?

50:25.939 --> 50:27.107
That's correct.

50:28.525 --> 50:31.611
They were discovered deep
in the glaciers of the Muryong Mountains.

50:31.695 --> 50:33.530
They were quite difficult to retrieve.

50:33.613 --> 50:37.200
So this parasite latches
onto the brain of its host,

50:37.826 --> 50:40.871
and that's when it mutates
into a monster like Seishin did?

50:41.872 --> 50:42.706
Not exactly.

50:44.166 --> 50:45.584
If it is the Najin alone,

50:46.376 --> 50:48.462
the host only turns into a predator.

50:49.212 --> 50:50.756
[unsettling music playing]

50:50.839 --> 50:52.799
[Kato] But it still retains
the outward appearance

50:52.883 --> 50:54.176
of its human form.

50:54.259 --> 50:55.260
In order to survive,

50:55.343 --> 50:57.471
the Najin controls them from the inside,

50:57.554 --> 50:59.056
hunting for human brains.

50:59.139 --> 51:01.141
- [dramatic music playing]
- [Chae-ok gasps]

51:07.022 --> 51:08.857
[Myeong-ja breathing heavily]

51:18.700 --> 51:20.160
[choked grunting]

51:20.243 --> 51:21.369
[Myeong-ja straining]

51:29.294 --> 51:30.545
[Tae-sang coughing]

51:33.381 --> 51:35.383
[Kato] The Najin is highly aggressive

51:35.467 --> 51:38.095
and more violent than most apex predators.

51:38.720 --> 51:42.432
It can analyze situations quickly
and heal its wounds almost immediately.

51:42.516 --> 51:44.017
[flesh knitting rapidly]

51:48.897 --> 51:50.273
So explain to me.

51:50.357 --> 51:52.651
Why does Seishin look disfigured
like the way that she does?

51:52.734 --> 51:56.947
Because she was given two injections.
One serum was combined with anthrax.

52:03.912 --> 52:04.830
[unlocking door]

52:15.215 --> 52:16.508
[refrigerator humming]

52:24.099 --> 52:25.725
Once injected with this serum,

52:25.809 --> 52:27.853
it mutates with the Najin parasite,

52:28.436 --> 52:30.230
as is the case with Seishin.

52:30.939 --> 52:33.733
From what you observed so far,
are there any weaknesses?

52:43.326 --> 52:44.786
Nitrogen weakens it,

52:45.871 --> 52:47.706
as well as sunlight and fire.

52:47.789 --> 52:49.583
[Mori breathing rapidly]

53:05.182 --> 53:06.057
[Myeong-ja gasps]

53:06.808 --> 53:07.851
[breathing heavily]

53:10.395 --> 53:11.980
[Tae-sang] Get a hold of yourself.

53:12.564 --> 53:13.773
What's wrong with you?

53:14.858 --> 53:16.026
[yells] Myeong-ja!

53:16.109 --> 53:17.861
[high-pitched ringing]

53:23.200 --> 53:25.035
[Lady Maeda] How horrible it must be

53:26.119 --> 53:29.873
to remember what it was like to be human
when trapped in that state.

53:31.291 --> 53:32.959
Something's happened to her.

53:34.544 --> 53:36.546
I think they experimented on her
at the hospital.

53:36.630 --> 53:38.215
[Tae-sang breathing heavily]

53:39.049 --> 53:40.759
[confused breathing]

53:41.259 --> 53:42.135
[whimpers softly]

53:43.428 --> 53:45.555
[clattering in distance]

53:47.766 --> 53:49.809
[pained gasping]

54:00.987 --> 54:03.448
There was a red flare
fired into the sky, Commissioner.

54:05.533 --> 54:07.035
[dramatic music playing]

54:07.118 --> 54:08.578
[panicked whimpering]

54:19.923 --> 54:21.007
[feet skidding]

54:21.925 --> 54:24.135
- [officer] Over here! Get her!
- [whistle blowing]

54:24.219 --> 54:25.804
[whistle blowing]

54:26.388 --> 54:28.181
[whistle blowing]

54:32.269 --> 54:33.353
[officer] Stop right there!

54:33.436 --> 54:34.729
[whistle blowing]

54:34.813 --> 54:36.606
- [panicked breathing]
- [whistle blowing]

54:37.190 --> 54:39.192
[whistle blowing]

54:39.276 --> 54:40.735
[suspenseful music building]

54:50.328 --> 54:52.205
[terrified panting]

54:58.962 --> 55:00.422
[whistle blowing]

55:00.505 --> 55:01.881
[whistles blowing]

55:03.925 --> 55:05.218
Don't lose her!

55:05.302 --> 55:06.886
- Find her!
- [others] Yes, sir!

55:07.470 --> 55:09.222
[whistle blowing]

55:10.974 --> 55:12.225
[whistle blowing]

55:12.309 --> 55:13.560
[whistle blowing]

55:16.104 --> 55:17.147
[running footsteps]

55:28.658 --> 55:30.493
[locking door]

55:30.577 --> 55:32.954
She was unable
to remember anything at first.

55:33.997 --> 55:35.248
But then her daughter showed up.

55:37.876 --> 55:39.127
What about a daughter?

55:40.170 --> 55:41.629
So Seishin was a mother?

55:42.339 --> 55:43.590
How do you know this?

55:44.174 --> 55:47.260
She broke into the hospital
hoping to find her long-lost mother.

55:47.344 --> 55:49.220
That's when the two were reunited.

55:49.304 --> 55:52.891
Somehow Seishin recognized her daughter,
and something changed.

55:54.726 --> 55:56.519
She was able to control the Najin.

55:57.312 --> 55:59.439
And what's the poor girl's name, I wonder?

55:59.522 --> 56:01.191
Her name is Yoon Chae-ok,

56:02.984 --> 56:04.486
and she works as a sleuth.

56:06.863 --> 56:08.323
[Ishikawa] I don't know if you heard,

56:08.406 --> 56:10.533
but Master Jang has found himself a woman.

56:11.034 --> 56:14.579
Her name is Yoon Chae-ok.
I heard she is a Joseon woman.

56:14.662 --> 56:16.206
[dramatic music playing]

56:18.083 --> 56:19.459
[screeching]

56:19.542 --> 56:20.960
- Find her!
- [others] Yes, sir!

56:21.044 --> 56:22.212
Search this way too!

56:22.295 --> 56:23.922
- Hurry up!
- [officer 2] This way!

56:24.005 --> 56:25.840
- Move quickly!
- [officer 3] Find her!

56:25.924 --> 56:26.925
[whistle blowing]

56:27.008 --> 56:28.134
[dramatic music continues]

56:29.094 --> 56:30.178
[whistle blowing]

56:30.845 --> 56:32.639
[distant clattering]

56:33.223 --> 56:34.432
[panicked gasping]

56:48.196 --> 56:50.448
[horn honking]

56:52.659 --> 56:53.743
[whistle blowing]

56:56.079 --> 56:57.288
[whistle blowing]

56:57.372 --> 56:58.790
There she is! Go after her!

57:00.208 --> 57:01.418
[truck engine revving]

57:03.336 --> 57:04.546
[whistle blowing]

57:05.463 --> 57:06.965
[tires screeching]

57:12.470 --> 57:13.304
Are you all right?

57:13.388 --> 57:15.390
If they catch Myeong-ja,
they might kill her

57:16.850 --> 57:19.436
or do something much worse
to her and her baby.

57:20.061 --> 57:21.521
Just like what happened to my mother.

57:21.604 --> 57:22.814
[whistle blowing]

57:23.982 --> 57:25.442
[officer 1] Go after her!

57:27.652 --> 57:28.736
Hurry!

57:28.820 --> 57:30.405
[whistles blowing]

57:30.488 --> 57:32.073
[officer 1] Hurry! Get her!

57:33.450 --> 57:34.742
Catch her!

57:36.119 --> 57:37.454
[whistle blowing]

57:37.537 --> 57:39.497
[eerie music playing]

57:51.551 --> 57:53.261
- [door closes]
- Let's get going.

57:55.555 --> 57:57.223
[Myeong-ja breathing heavily]

58:00.477 --> 58:02.312
[whimpers] I don't want to die!

58:03.313 --> 58:04.898
Please don't kill me!

58:07.025 --> 58:08.318
Please let me live!

58:13.448 --> 58:14.282
[grunts]

58:14.908 --> 58:15.992
[officer 1] Hold up!

58:16.659 --> 58:18.411
- [sobbing]
- [officer 1] That way!

58:27.545 --> 58:28.588
[gunshot]

58:30.006 --> 58:31.257
[officer 1] Find her! That way!

58:31.341 --> 58:33.843
- Don't let her get away!
- [officer 4] Stop right there!

58:41.643 --> 58:44.103
Don't kill me!
Please don't kill me! Please don't!

58:45.063 --> 58:47.106
I don't wanna die! I don't wanna die!

58:47.857 --> 58:49.734
I don't wanna die! Don't kill me!

58:50.318 --> 58:51.778
I don't wanna die!

58:51.861 --> 58:53.029
[Myeong-ja sobbing]

58:59.661 --> 59:01.204
[unsettling music playing]

59:53.006 --> 59:54.716
[eerie vocalizing]

01:00:42.513 --> 01:00:44.515
[music fades]

01:00:44.599 --> 01:00:49.812
["Time" by Baek A playing]
♪ Candles lit in the room ♪

01:00:50.438 --> 01:00:55.485
♪ Staring for long time ♪

01:00:56.444 --> 01:01:01.324
♪ Where the wind came from ♪

01:01:02.617 --> 01:01:07.580
♪ Went out through the door ♪

01:01:08.581 --> 01:01:10.583
[vocalizing]

01:01:29.185 --> 01:01:34.899
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

01:01:35.566 --> 01:01:42.031
♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪

01:01:42.615 --> 01:01:46.869
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall ♪

01:01:47.537 --> 01:01:52.583
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

01:01:53.668 --> 01:01:55.169
[vocalizing]

01:02:20.445 --> 01:02:21.904
[music fades out]
